- description: >-
    Aegis's Go code-scanning suite: the standard suite, with go/path-injection
    swapped for the copy in this pack that additionally knows about Aegis's
    own path-confinement helpers (see AegisPathSanitizers.qll) so it stops
    re-flagging call sites downstream of an already-validated path.
- queries: .
  from: codeql/go-queries
- apply: code-scanning-selectors.yml
  from: codeql/suite-helpers
- exclude:
    id: go/path-injection
- queries: .
